d focus of zen word games, where each word puzzle is a step toward becoming the ultimate word explorer.<br><br>\u27a4 Take a journey through the beautiful cities of the world of wonders. From Paris to New York, there are more than 20 cities with various landmarks for players to discover. Words and wonders come together in this crossword game to satisfy the players&#39; wanderlust. The extensive spin-wheel system provides plenty of free rewards for players who seek to complete all sets of crossword puzzles and word games. Play the daily levels to uncover jigsaw paintings and witness the artistic marvels. Earn rewards for completing a month of daily levels as well. <br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>\u25cf Swipe letters to align words, filling blanks horizontally and vertically on the board.<br>\u25cf Use the Hint button for clues.<br>\u25cf Shuffle letters with the Shuffle button.<br>\u25cf Earn coins for hints by purchasing or watching videos.<br>\u25cf Discover extra words for bonus rewards.<br>\u25cf Complete five consecutive levels to activate a streak bonus for extra free hints.<br> <br>FEATURES<br>\u25cf Hundreds of unique challenges in this word connect and word escape game.<br>\u25cf Free Daily bonus rewards.<br>\u25cf You will say wow with unique themes.<br>\u25cf Simple &amp; easy to play, hard-to-beat connections word game.<br>\u25cf Suitable for adults to train their word search skills.<br>\u25cf Great exercise for brain training with releasing puzzles.<br>\u25cf Play OFFLINE at any time and anywhere.<br>\u25cf Play brain teasers games without the internet.<br>\u25cf No wifi games.<br>\u25cf Compatible with the definition of free word games for adults.<br>\u25cf Travel Theme with unique cities from all over the world.<br>\u25cf You will find many similar word games, but this word connect will stand out.<br>\u25cf Word games offline and friendly games.<br>\u25cf Thanks for playing word connect! Enjoy your time in this unlimited word connections game!<br>\u25cf Word pu